inical surge, cooling-center capacity,\naccessible transit, public communication, logistics, staffing, candidate\nlineage, and independent readiness.\n\nBind each action and gate to owners, prerequisites, observations, the current\ncandidate, falsifiers, rollback, and evidence that retires temporary controls.\nPreserve observations versus gates, probability versus coverage, installed\nversus usable capacity, reserve versus flow, median versus percentile, hours\nversus days, source-local authority, and current versus stale evidence.\n\nChecks are candidate-bound mechanical feedback. They do not independently\nauthorize operations, readiness, submission, or closure.\n\n\nEXACT NEWLY EXTERNALIZED RESULTS\n--- NEWLY EXTERNALIZED RESULT-004 ---\n{\"object_id\":\"batch:GRID:61-94+WATER:61-94\",\"object_version\":\"0a512ceebbf0032537742c137a1c3263e34aa76632bf48eec856083287b0b871\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-004\",\"result_kind\":\"source_observation\",\"schema\":\"ceiba-action-result-v1\"}\n--- exact result body ---\n{\"schema\":\"architecture-batch-observation-v0\",\"segments\":[{\"end_line\":94,\"source_id\":\"GRID\",\"start_line\":61},{\"end_line\":94,\"source_id\":\"WATER\",\"start_line\":61}],\"total_source_bytes\":4174}\n--- exact batch segment 1 ---\n{\"end_line\":94,\"source_id\":\"GRID\",\"source_path\":\"sources/GRID_COOLING_POWER.md\",\"source_sha256\":\"2149dcb753ebd817f10869d394e30f61e89ac46d6d4de2ace9bde1cb7c13299d\",\"source_size_bytes\":5546,\"start_line\":61}\n--- exact source range ---\n| GRD-043 | backup-plant | v6 | 28.6 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-044 | feeder-east | v6 | 30.3 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-045 | feeder-west | v6 | 29.1 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-046 | library-hub | v6 | 30.8 | megawatts | superseded |\n| GRD-047 | backup-plant | v6 | 29.6 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-048 | feeder-east | v6 | 28.4 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-049 | feeder-west | v6 | 30.1 | megawatts | current |\n| GRD-050 | library-hub | v6 | 28.9 | megawatts |